# LeetBlocks - Complete PictoBlox Clone

A comprehensive implementation plan for creating a full-featured PictoBlox clone.

---

## 📊 PictoBlox Feature Analysis

Based on the home screen, PictoBlox offers **6 major modes**:

![PictoBlox Home Screen](uploaded_image_1766135642252.png)

### Main Modes (From Screenshot)

| Mode | Age | Description | Status in LeetBlocks |
|------|-----|-------------|---------------------|
| **Junior Blocks** | 4+ | Simplified drag-drop blocks | ❌ Not Started |
| **Blocks** | 7+ | Full Scratch-like blocks | 🟡 Partial |
| **Py Editor** | 12+ | Python text editor | ❌ Not Started |
| **Py Notebook** | 12+ | Jupyter-style notebook | ❌ Not Started |
| **Machine Learning** | 12+ | Train ML models | ❌ Not Started |
| **3D and XR Studio** | 12+ | AR/VR/3D environment | ❌ Not Started |

---

## 🔧 Implementation Roadmap

### Phase 1: Core IDE (Current State = ~40%)

**What LeetBlocks Already Has:**
- [x] Electron + React + Blockly foundation
- [x] Stage Mode with sprite/stage canvas
- [x] Upload Mode with Arduino code generation
- [x] Basic block categories (Events, Motion, Looks, Sound, Control, Sensing, Operators, Variables, My Blocks)
- [x] Hardware connection UI (port select, connect)
- [x] Serial monitor

**What Needs to Be Added:**

#### 1.1 Home/Welcome Screen
```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│            What would you like to do?            │
├────────────────────┬────────────────────────────┤
│   Block Coding     │      Python Coding         │
│  ┌────┐  ┌────┐   │   ┌────┐    ┌────┐        │
│  │ JR │  │BLKS│   │   │ PY │    │ NB │        │
│  └────┘  └────┘   │   └────┘    └────┘        │
│  Junior   Blocks   │  Py Editor  Py Notebook   │
├────────────────────┴────────────────────────────┤
│  ┌─────────────────┐  ┌─────────────────────┐  │
│  │   ML Studio     │  │   3D/XR Studio      │  │
│  └─────────────────┘  └─────────────────────┘  │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

#### 1.2 Project Management
- [ ] New/Open/Save projects (.sb3 compatible format)
- [ ] Recent projects list
- [ ] Project templates
- [ ] Export as executable

