#### 2.2 Missing Blocks to Add

**Events (Missing):**
- `when backdrop switches to [__]`
- `when [loudness/timer] > [10]`
- `broadcast [message]`
- `broadcast [message] and wait`
- `when I receive [message]`

**Looks (Missing):**
- `think [message] for [2] seconds`
- `think [message]`
- `switch costume to [__]`
- `switch backdrop to [__]`
- `switch backdrop to [__] and wait`
- `next backdrop`
- `go to [front/back] layer`
- `go [forward/backward] [1] layers`

**Control (Missing):**
- `if <> then / else`
- `wait until <>`
- `repeat until <>`
- `create clone of [myself]`
- `when I start as a clone`
- `delete this clone`

**Sensing (Missing):**
- `touching color [color]?`
- `color [color] is touching [color]?`
- `distance to [sprite/mouse]`
- `ask [question] and wait`
- `answer` (reporter)
- `loudness` (reporter)
- `days since 2000`
- `username`

