## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> This is a very large scope project. Please review the priorities and let me know:
> 1. Which features are most important to you?
> 2. Should I focus on completing Block Coding first, or start on Python/ML?
> 3. Any specific hardware boards to prioritize?
> 4. Do you want the Junior Blocks (simplified) mode?
